---
title: Goal Management Flow
---
flowchart TD
    subgraph Create
        G1[Create Goal] --> G2[title required]
        G2 --> G3[Set status: active]
        G3 --> G4[Save to DB]
    end

    subgraph Update
        G5[Update Goal] --> G6[Validate fields]
        G6 --> G7[Persist order changes]
    end

    subgraph Complete
        G8[Complete Goal] --> G9[User marks done]
        G9 --> G10[Set completedAt]
    end
